<title>JAMAICA: CRICKET-JAMAICA V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-JAMAICA V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the third day of</p>
<p>the four-day match between Jamaica and India at Sabina Park on</p>
<p>Sunday:</p>
<p>Jamaica first innings 453-9 declared (L.Williams 102 not</p>
<p>out)</p>
<p>India first innings (overnight 66-1)</p>
<p> V.V.Laxman run out		98</p>
<p> N.Sidhu c Ford b Walsh	   7</p>
<p> R.Dravid b Rose		   86</p>
<p> S.Tendulkar b Rose		 6</p>
<p> S.Ganguly not out		 45</p>
<p> M.Azharruddin c&amp;b Rose	   1</p>
<p> N.Mongia not out		  15</p>
<p> Extras (lb-6, nb-7)	     13</p>
<p> Total (for five wickets)     271</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-18, 2-196, 3-208, 4-222, 5-223.</p>
<p>Bowling: Walsh 18-7-27-1, Rose 21-9-45-3, Williams</p>
<p>22-5-37-0, Perry 27-7-79-0, Murphy 32-9-69-0, Adams 3-1-8-0.</p>
